/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Elkhart County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 36 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 56% of normal in January to February and 72% in August to September. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 200% of normal on the middle. Grid 25977 had its driest year in 1963 at 69%.</p>"}
